+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 In the assets playground, check that the icon, apple-touch-icon and manifest links in index.html build to hashed files under assets/ instead of data URLs (playground/assets/__tests__/assets.spec.ts) [AC-1] [AC-2]
+
+## 2. Asset URLs
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Let callers of fileToBuiltUrl and urlToBuiltUrl pass shouldInline to force the inline decision, keeping the size heuristics when it is left out (packages/vite/src/node/plugins/asset.ts)
+
+## 3. HTML
+
+- [ ] 3.1 Pass shouldInline: false for link rels that must stay files: icon, apple-touch-icon, apple-touch-startup-image and manifest (packages/vite/src/node/plugins/html.ts)
